      "content": "<h3>Best practices</h3>\n<p>What the internals tell you to do.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Override <code>equals</code> and <code>hashCode</code> together, using the same immutable fields (or use a <code>record</code>).</li>\n<li>Use immutable keys: <code>String</code>, <code>Integer</code>, enums, records.</li>\n<li>Presize the map when the final size is known.</li>\n<li>Make keys <code>Comparable</code> if many may collide: the tree bin can use it.</li>\n<li>Never share a plain HashMap between threads that write; use <code>ConcurrentHashMap</code>.</li>\n<li>Do not rely on iteration order.</li>\n</ul>"
